   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 2145606220,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "L2 system contracts: updated\nonly via protocol upgrades\n(proposed by CTM owner,\napproved by chain admin)",
   "originalText": "L2 system contracts: updated\nonly via protocol upgrades\n(proposed by CTM owner,\napproved by chain admin)",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "el93",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2470,
   "y": 330,
   "width": 158.76000000000002,
   "height": 35.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#343a40",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1266582621,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 2139443954,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "dashed arrow = read /\ntx executed later",
   "originalText": "dashed arrow = read /\ntx executed later",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "el94",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 900,
   "width": 872.1,
   "height": 318.75,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#343a40",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1738618365,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 943717461,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "L1\n1. Bridgehub owner/admin calls L1Bridgehub.createNewChain. The base token asset id must\n    already be registered (addTokenAssetId). Records CTM, base token and settlement layer = L1.\n2. Bridgehub calls ChainTypeManager.createNewChain; CTM checks the initial cut and\n    force-deployment hashes.\n3. CTM deploys the chain's DiamondProxy.\n4. The DiamondProxy constructor delegatecalls DiamondInit: initializes chain storage,\n    including the genesis batch root l2LogsRootHashes[0].\n5. CTM calls Admin.genesisUpgrade on the new diamond.\n6. The diamond delegatecalls L1GenesisUpgrade: builds the L2 genesis upgrade tx\n    (ComplexUpgrader -> L2GenesisUpgrade), stores its hash, sets the protocol version.\n7. CTM calls pauseDepositsBeforeInitiatingMigration: the chain starts with deposits paused.\n8. Bridgehub registers the diamond and calls L1MessageRoot.addNewChain(chainId, 0).\n9. Bridgehub calls L1MessageRoot.seedGenesisRoot(chainId).\n10. L1MessageRoot reads l2LogsRootHash(0) from the chain and pushes it as the batch-0 leaf.",
   "originalText": "L1\n1. Bridgehub owner/admin calls L1Bridgehub.createNewChain. The base token asset id must\n    already be registered (addTokenAssetId). Records CTM, base token and settlement layer = L1.\n2. Bridgehub calls ChainTypeManager.createNewChain; CTM checks the initial cut and\n    force-deployment hashes.\n3. CTM deploys the chain's DiamondProxy.\n4. The DiamondProxy constructor delegatecalls DiamondInit: initializes chain storage,\n    including the genesis batch root l2LogsRootHashes[0].\n5. CTM calls Admin.genesisUpgrade on the new diamond.\n6. The diamond delegatecalls L1GenesisUpgrade: builds the L2 genesis upgrade tx\n    (ComplexUpgrader -> L2GenesisUpgrade), stores its hash, sets the protocol version.\n7. CTM calls pauseDepositsBeforeInitiatingMigration: the chain starts with deposits paused.\n8. Bridgehub registers the diamond and calls L1MessageRoot.addNewChain(chainId, 0).\n9. Bridgehub calls L1MessageRoot.seedGenesisRoot(chainId).\n10. L1MessageRoot reads l2LogsRootHash(0) from the chain and pushes it as the batch-0 leaf.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "el95",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1320,
   "y": 900,
   "width": 881.2800000000001,
   "height": 276.25,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#343a40",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1639468433,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1735838731,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "L2\n11. The first batch starts with the genesis upgrade tx (from L2_FORCE_DEPLOYER), which calls\n      L2ComplexUpgrader.upgrade. L1 commit enforces its inclusion.\n12. ComplexUpgrader delegatecalls the predeployed L2GenesisUpgrade.\n13. initL2 on the core contracts; deploys the L2WrappedBaseToken proxy and the NTV token beacon.\n14. L2Bridgehub.setAddresses wires asset router, message root, chain asset handler\n      and the chain registration sender.\n15. initL2 on L2AssetTracker, L2InteropHandler, InteropCenter, L2BaseToken;\n      L2NativeTokenVault.registerBaseTokenIfNeeded.\n16. initL2 on the atomic-interop built-ins.\n\nAll L2 contracts are predeployed at fixed addresses in the ZKsync OS genesis state; the\ngenesis upgrade only initializes them (no ContractDeployer, no SystemContext.setChainId).",
   "originalText": "L2\n11. The first batch starts with the genesis upgrade tx (from L2_FORCE_DEPLOYER), which calls\n      L2ComplexUpgrader.upgrade. L1 commit enforces its inclusion.\n12. ComplexUpgrader delegatecalls the predeployed L2GenesisUpgrade.\n13. initL2 on the core contracts; deploys the L2WrappedBaseToken proxy and the NTV token beacon.\n14. L2Bridgehub.setAddresses wires asset router, message root, chain asset handler\n      and the chain registration sender.\n15. initL2 on L2AssetTracker, L2InteropHandler, InteropCenter, L2BaseToken;\n      L2NativeTokenVault.registerBaseTokenIfNeeded.\n16. initL2 on the atomic-interop built-ins.\n\nAll L2 contracts are predeployed at fixed addresses in the ZKsync OS genesis state; the\ngenesis upgrade only initializes them (no ContractDeployer, no SystemContext.setChainId).",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  }
 ],
 "appState": {
  "viewBackgroundColor": "#ffffff",
  "gridSize": null
 },
